//! edit.cmdtab_yew — yew's own registry rows: commands sagitta does not
//! have. Hand-written (`cmdtab.lu` is generated from sagitta's `cmd.c` and
//! never edited), in `CMDTAB`'s format: one row per command, eight fields
//! separated by 0x1f (name, handler, arity, flags, help, recorder word,
//! E-mode meta, the handler's file). `cmdreg_builtin` registers them after
//! C's rows, so every C command keeps C's id.
//!
//! - `ed.keys` (yw15): the keys help (`edit.keyshelp`). Flags 0, as C's
//!   `ed.macro.list`, a picker opener C does not mark as prompting.

/// The number of rows in `CMDTAB_YEW`.
pub const CMDTAB_YEW_ROWS: int = 8

/// yew's own descriptor rows, one per line, fields separated by 0x1f.
pub const CMDTAB_YEW: str = """
ed.keys\x1fyew_keys_cmd_open\x1f0\x1f0\x1fList every mode's key bindings, marking what is not ported yet (yew's own)\x1f\x1f\x1fsrc/edit/keyshelp.lu
ed.edit.lines.dedent\x1fyew_lines_cmd_dedent\x1f0\x1f156\x1fDedent current or selected lines, keeping mode and selection\x1fline_dedent\x1f\x1fsrc/edit/lines.lu
ed.edit.lines.up\x1fyew_lines_cmd_up\x1f0\x1f156\x1fMove current or selected lines up\x1fline_up\x1f\x1fsrc/edit/lines.lu
ed.edit.lines.down\x1fyew_lines_cmd_down\x1f0\x1f156\x1fMove current or selected lines down\x1fline_down\x1f\x1fsrc/edit/lines.lu
ed.shadow.accept_or_line\x1fyew_shadow_cmd_accept_or_line\x1f0\x1f520\x1fAccept a visible shadow line, otherwise move the current line down\x1f\x1f\x1fsrc/edit/shadow_context.lu
ed.cursor.add.at\x1fyew_cursor_add_at_cmd\x1f1\x1f12\x1fAdd or promote a collapsed caret at a grapheme offset in L/W/B/I; H selections are held\x1fcursor_add_at\x1f\x1fsrc/edit/cursor_add.lu
ed.cursor.key.above\x1fyew_cursor_key_above_cmd\x1f0\x1f12\x1fCtrl+Alt above: add and promote a collapsed destination in L/W/B/I\x1fcursor_key_above\x1f\x1fsrc/edit/cursor_add.lu
ed.cursor.key.below\x1fyew_cursor_key_below_cmd\x1f0\x1f12\x1fCtrl+Alt below: add and promote a collapsed destination in L/W/B/I\x1fcursor_key_below\x1f\x1fsrc/edit/cursor_add.lu
"""
